{
  "_readme": [
    "Frozen API fixtures for the Playwright suite - the exact shapes apps/api/schemas.py returns.",
    "This is JSON, not TypeScript, so that apps/api/tests/test_e2e_fixture_contract.py can validate",
    "every entry against the real Pydantic models without a Node round-trip. A field renamed in the",
    "backend therefore breaks a Python test instead of leaving the E2E suite passing against a shape",
    "the server stopped sending. Values are taken from recorded evidence (EXP-027/028/029 gate-2",
    "hashes, EXP-034 memory figures) rather than invented, so a reader can cross-check them."
  ],

